        'Change history ka customer_id, region, valid_from aur valid_to return karo. Pehle equal customer_id/effective_at pairs mein greatest update_id rakho. valid_from effective_at hai; valid_to next effective_at ya last version ke liye NULL. Intervals [valid_from, valid_to) hain. customer_id, valid_from se sort karo.',
